{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "We want to know, Mister Gilchrist, how you, an honorable man, ever came to commit such an action as that of yesterday.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["We", " want", " to", " know", ",", " Mister", " Gil", "christ", ",", " how", " you", ",", " an", " honorable", " man", ",", " ever", " came", " to", " commit", " such", " an", " action", " as", " that", " of", " yesterday", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "There might be a bit of poetry here and there, but most of this place was such desperate prose.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["There", " might", " be", " a", " bit", " of", " poetry", " here", " and", " there", ",", " but", " most", " of", " this", " place", " was", " such", " desperate", " prose", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "It is a very fine old place of red brick, softened by a pale powdery lichen, which has dispersed itself with happy irregularity, so as to bring the red brick into terms of friendly companionship with the limestone ornaments surrounding the three gables, the windows, and the doorplace.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["It", " is", " a", " very", " fine", " old", " place", " of", " red", " brick", ",", " softened", " by", " a", " pale", " pow", "d", "ery", " l", "ichen", ",", " which", " has", " dispersed", " itself", " with", " happy", " irregular", "ity", ",", " so", " as", " to", " bring", " the", " red", " brick", " into", " terms", " of", " friendly", " companions", "hip", " with", " the", " limestone", " ornaments", " surrounding", " the", " three", " g", "ables", ",", " the", " windows", ",", " and", " the", " door", "place", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Oh, I've no doubt it's in capital order.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Oh", ",", " I", "'ve", " no", " doubt", " it", "'s", " in", " capital", " order", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Unless he could secure an engine of smoother running and more exactly governed and regulated than those available for his dynamo and lamp, Edison realized that he would find it almost impossible to give a steady light.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Unless", " he", " could", " secure", " an", " engine", " of", " smoother", " running", " and", " more", " exactly", " governed", " and", " regulated", " than", " those", " available", " for", " his", " dynam", "o", " and", " lamp", ",", " Edison", " realized", " that", " he", " would", " find", " it", " almost", " impossible", " to", " give", " a", " steady", " light", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "I didn't have any fears if I worked it rightly,\" said the old gentleman complacently.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["I", " didn", "'t", " have", " any", " fears", " if", " I", " worked", " it", " rightly", ",\"", " said", " the", " old", " gentleman", " compl", "ac", "ently", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Indeed, he had looked away with the purpose of not seeing it.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Indeed", ",", " he", " had", " looked", " away", " with", " the", " purpose", " of", " not", " seeing", " it", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "We never had so many of them in here before.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["We", " never", " had", " so", " many", " of", " them", " in", " here", " before", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "It's exciting to see everything growing so fast, and to get the grass cut.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["It", "'s", " exciting", " to", " see", " everything", " growing", " so", " fast", ",", " and", " to", " get", " the", " grass", " cut", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "I can't pray to have the things I want,\" he said slowly, \"and I won't pray not to have them—not if I'm damned for it.\"", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["I", " can", "'t", " pray", " to", " have", " the", " things", " I", " want", ",\"", " he", " said", " slowly", ",", " \"", "and", " I", " won", "'t", " pray", " not", " to", " have", " them", "—not", " if", " I", "'m", " damned", " for", " it", ".\""], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
